Why Is This Called Self-Attention?

Because:

Sentence attends to itself.

No external information is needed.

Real Formula

This is the most important equation in transformers:

Meaning of Each Part
QKᵀ

Measures similarity.

√dk

Prevents scores from becoming too large.

Softmax

Converts scores into probabilities.

× V

Combines information from important words.

Why Is This Revolutionary?

Traditional RNN:

Word1 → Word2 → Word3 → Word4

Information must travel sequentially.

Transformer:

Word1 ↔ Word2
  ↕      ↕
Word3 ↔ Word4

Every word directly interacts with every other word.

